152:| 4 | tower round window | x 52..53, y 11..12, z 9 |
153:| 4 | belfry openings | x 52..53 at z 9 and z 12; z 10..11 at x 51 and x 54; y 16..17 |
188:| school bell | (17, 15, 14) `attachment: ceiling` under the y 16 cap deck | tower |
189:| church tower deck (on beams over the narthex) | y 8 (beam deck x 51..54 z 9..12) and belfry deck y 15, bell (52, 17, 10) under y 18 | tower |
190:| church tower ladder | on the tower back wall inside: ladder (52, 9..15, 11) facing north on wall z 12, hole in decks (52, 8, 11) and (52, 15, 11); reached by a ladder (55, 2..7, 16) facing west on the nave wall x 56 to a gallery deck y 7 x 50..55 z 10..11 | stairs |
212:| 4 | gallery / tower decks | 7 / 8; 8; 15 | gallery x 50..55 z 10..11; tower interior x 52..53 z 10..11 |
253:- `bellCupola(g)`, `belfry(g)`, `spireCap(g)`: as FACADES; clock-free; bell attachment ceiling; spire steps in 1 per row.
263:Floors per FLOORS. Detail room boxes are in the JSON answer. Doors/openings per OPENINGS. Stairs: farm flight x26..30 z13 (steps y2..6); owner flight x86 z14->10; gin ladder (2,1..6,15); church tower ladder (52,9..15,11); barn ladder (64,1..9,14).
